<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kanzen year net down 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kanzen year net down 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 8.03	vs	 10.91</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	9.4	 vs	 12.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 216.47	vs	203.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  14.08	vs	 19.07</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   3.17	vs  less  5.27</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)     10.0	 vs	 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Kanzen Bhd. It makes and distributes steel pipes and bedding products.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
